The last build META shows the cpanfile is the sole prereq source, so gaps ship as-is. Used by lib but undeclared: Digest::SHA, MIME::Base64, POSIX, Carp, Scalar::Util (the last newly used). All core, all undeclared. Nothing declared is unused. Crypt::Age is Getty-authored and unpinned; the house rule wants it pinned to its latest release, 0.001. No minimum perl version is declared. The interop test imports decode_utf8 from Encode and never uses it: drop the import or declare Encode.
